        "PantheonExpert0": {
          "DisplayName": "First Stardew",
          "Tooltip": "+180 maximum life. After 4s without damage, moving grants a 180-point shield; 15s refill cooldown.\nHit counters accept at most one valid primary enemy hit per 10 ticks; no dummies or recursive procs. Shields exclude PvP, traps and environment, add no immunity and always leave at least 1 damage.\nUnequipping clears temporary benefits; cooldowns persist through unequip, death and saves. Identical accessories do not stack."
        },
        "PantheonExpert1": {
          "DisplayName": "Mirror of Ophir",
          "Tooltip": "+8% generic crit. Ten valid hits on the same enemy launch an Insight Star with 62000 base damage, scaled by generic damage; changing target or pausing hits for 3s resets the count.\nHit counters accept at most one valid primary enemy hit per 10 ticks; no dummies or recursive procs. Shields exclude PvP, traps and environment, add no immunity and always leave at least 1 damage.\nUnequipping clears temporary benefits; cooldowns persist through unequip, death and saves. Identical accessories do not stack."
        },
